# the white keys play the Lead in the scale (key i: degree i from the root up, in its register): the first piece, F
# Dorian, the fourth white key (w3, key 6): degree 3, Bb4 (70); its key lit while it sounds; the black keys do nothing;
# the scale is never changed from the keys (F Dorian: 0 2 3 5 7 9 10 from the root, 1709)
wait 500
expect pool 1709
key w3 down
wait 300
expect lastnote_ch3 70
expect litkey6 1
key w3 up
wait 300
expect litkey6 0
key b1 down
wait 300
key b1 up
wait 300
expect pool 1709
